From ae5845ac1a80085a7a1f6b47049b759a28fcdb6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:24:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD terminal visual modes so users can copy pane text

TerminalUi owns character, line, and block selections for the focused pane, while terminal adapters emit copied text through OSC 52 so yanked chat or control-pane text reaches the user's clipboard. The commit keeps the reviewed harness and terminal-app coverage with the behavior and documents the terminal workflow.
